2Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div class=\"win-map-frame\">\n      <img src=\"52232659-a1d7-48db-bfd6-5cfd156b8c4c\" alt=\"Turin skyline at sunset with billboards advertising music, art, food and cultural events across the city\">\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n\n  <div class=\"scroll-hint\">\n    <span>Scroll · Meet the users<\u002Fspan>\n    <div class=\"arrow\"><\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<!-- ============ SLIDE 4: PERSONAS ============ -->\n<section class=\"section personas\" id=\"s4\">\n  <div class=\"solution-head\">\n    <div class=\"section-meta\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"step\">4<\u002Fspan> Personas · who we're building for<\u002Fdiv>\n    <h1 class=\"slide-title\">Many interests. <em>One place.<\u002Fem><\u002Fh1>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n\n  <div class=\"personas-grid\">\n    <div class=\"persona iris\">\n      <div class=\"persona-top\">\n        <div class=\"persona-avatar\">\n          <img src=\"\" data-persona-id=\"1494790108377-be9c29b29330\" alt=\"Iris\">\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"persona-id\">\n          <h3 class=\"name\">Iris<\u002Fh3>\n          <div class=\"age\">22 · International student<\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <span class=\"persona-tag\">🌍 The Discoverer<\u002Fspan>\n      <p class=\"persona-profile\">\n        A newly arrived <strong>Erasmus student<\u002Fstrong> in Turin who wants to explore the city, join local events, and meet new people.\n      <\u002Fp>\n      <div class=\"persona-wants\">\n        <div class=\"wants-label\">What she wants<\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"want-row\"><span class=\"bullet\"><\u002Fspan> Find international-friendly events<\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"want-row\"><span class=\"bullet\"><\u002Fspan> Integrate into Turin life<\u002Fdiv>\n        <div class=\"want-row\"><span class=\"bullet\"><\u002Fspan> Build a new social circle<\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div class=\"persona-pain\">\n        <span 